WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:05.277
As always, my mom will come in a few minutes.

2
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:08.449
Mom: Wake up! It's time to get

3
00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.128
up. Hana: But I'm

4
00:00:11.129 --> 00:00:13.610
sleepy. I'm so tired.

5
00:00:13.611 --> 00:00:15.612
Mom: It's already 7:30.

6
00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:18.955
I told you to go to bed earlier. Hana:

7
00:00:18.956 --> 00:00:23.506
Okay, okay, I'm getting up now!

8
00:00:23.507 --> 00:00:28.386
Mom: Put your pajamas away, and don't forget to make your bed.

9
00:00:28.387 --> 00:00:30.303
I'll be in the kitchen. Wake

10
00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:34.095
Bada up please. Hana:

11
00:00:34.096 --> 00:00:38.959
Bada, put your pajamas away and make your bed too. Bada:

12
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.253
Why do I always have to make my bed? Hana:

13
00:00:43.254 --> 00:00:46.802
You know we need to keep our rooms neat.

14
00:00:46.803 --> 00:00:51.666
Bada: You are not my mother, and this is my room!

15
00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:54.698
I can do whatever I want!

16
00:00:54.699 --> 00:00:58.752
Hana: I'm telling Mom. Mom!

17
00:00:58.753 --> 00:01:04.360
So the day began, with my busy morning.

